# Every call of the three functions hands them an element of the list or what was computed from one, the call of steps() by itself too, and they only compute with it.
# The bits of a NaN go in and come back as they are. The count of steps is an ordinary number.
# The entry checks leave by a tail call, so they return what the functions behind them return.
